<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd">
<html>
<head>
	<meta content="text/html;charset=utf-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
	<title>Intel 註冊確認</title>
	<style>/* Font Definitions */ @font-face { font-family: "Intel Clear"; panose-1: 2 11 5 4 2 2 2 2 2 4; mso-font-charset: 0; mso-generic-font-family: swiss; mso-font-pitch: variable; mso-font-signature: 3 0 0 0 1 0; } /* Style Definitions */ a { color: #003C71; font-family: "Intel Clear","TAHOMA" !important; } p.uppercase { text-transform: uppercase; }</style>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; background-color:#f9f9f9;background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;      height: 100%;      outline: medium none;">
<table style="background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 50px; overflow: hidden; width: 550pt; line-height: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 320px;">
<td colspan="2" style="color: #086db6; font-size: 24pt; padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; height: 320px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear Pro','TAHOMA'; color: #003c71; font-size: 28pt;"><img src="https://messagecenter.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/34749eb0-3742-11ec-9e86-55b8d111e922.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; height: 17px;"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5; color: #e5e5e5; border: 0 none; height: 1px;" /></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" id="emailMainDiv" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 30px; height: 20px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"><b style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #086db6; font-size: 10pt;">親愛的 {!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName},</b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailBody" style="height: 152px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 15px; padding-right: 50px; height: 152px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">感謝您對 Intel 開發人員專區的關注。然而，在審核您的申請後，很遺憾地通知您，您的 Premier 帳戶申請未通過。申請未通過的部分原因可能包括：</p>
<ul>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">申請不符開發人員專區 Premier 計畫的標準。</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;"><span>開發人員專區 Premier</span> 的存取申請不允許使用個人電子郵件。您必須以公司電子郵件地址提交申請。</li>
<li style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">如要得到 Intel <span>開發人員專區</span>的 Premier 存取權限，貴公司必須和 Intel&reg; 簽訂企業保密協議（CNDA）。</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">您可繼續使用您的 Standard 帳戶存取開發人員專區的公開內容。如果您認為您的申請是被錯誤拒絕，請透過電話或電子郵件聯絡<a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/forms/support/my-intel-sign-on-support.html">帳戶協助</a>以獲取更多資訊。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="salutationDiv" style="padding-bottom: 5px; height: 52px;">
<td colspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 18px; height: 52px;">敬祝　商祺<br />註冊管理員<br />開發者專區</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 52.6667px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 110px; padding-top: 25px; line-height: 18px; height: 52.6667px;">
<p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #62686e;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">請勿回覆此電子郵件訊息。此郵件是系統自動傳送。為確保您可以繼續收到我們的電子郵件，請將我們加進您的通訊錄。</span><br /><br /><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">此外，您也可接洽我們的數家經銷商，取得用以協助您專案的資源。 </span><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel&reg; 解決方案文件庫</em>：<a href="https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary">https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>產品與價格相關問題，請聯絡您的主機板 OEM、Intel 授權代理商（IAD）或 Intel 授權供應商（IAS） 。您可以在下方找到 IAD 或 IAS 清單：</em><a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html">https://www.intel.com/content/www/tw/zh/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel 計畫的資訊與支援請見：</em><a href="https://www.intel.com.tw/partner-alliance">https://www.intel.com.tw/partner-alliance</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>產品資訊請見：</em><u></u><a href="https://ark.intel.com/">https://ark.intel.com/</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>軟體與驅動程式下載中心：</em><strong></strong><a href="https://downloadcenter.intel.com/">https://downloadcenter.intel.com/</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel 社群：</em><em></em><a href="https://community.intel.com/?profile.language=zh-TW">https://community.intel.com/</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel 解決方案市場目錄：</em><a href="https://marketplace.intel.com/">https://marketplace.intel.com/</a><a href="https://marketplace.intel.com/"></a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel 客戶支援：</em><a href="https://www.intel.com/support">https://www.intel.com/support</a></span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; padding-top: 15px; height: 17px;" align="center"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5; color: #e5e5e5; border: 0 none; height: 1px;" /></td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter" style="height: 32px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 16px; color: #666666; padding-top: 13px; height: 32px;">Intel 承諾保護您的隱私權。更多資訊<br />請參閱 <a href="http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel 隱私權聲明。</a><a href="http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Cookie 注意事項。</a></td>
<td rowspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-top: 10px; height: 48px;">
<div style="margin-right: -20px;"><img hspace="0px;" src="http://www.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/myIntelLogo.jpg" height="62px" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter2" style="height: 16px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; color: #666666; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 16px; height: 16px;"><a href="http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/terms-of-use.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important;">法律聲明</a> &verbar; <a href="http://www.intel.com.tw/content/www/tw/zh/legal/trademarks.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">商標</a> <span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666;">&copy;</span> <span style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; color: #666666;">Intel Corporation。</span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 10px;">
<td style="display: none; height: 10px;"></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 53px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 53px;">
